{"id": "ml-c1-sinusoidal-8", "title": "Mesh Currents with Complex Matrices (Example 9.12)", "ar": "تيارات الحلقات بمصفوفة مركّبة (مثال 9.12)", "lesson": "c1-sinusoidal-8", "course": "circuits-1", "level": "", "file": "matlab/dl/ml-c1-sinusoidal-8.m", "checks": 3, "sections": [{"t": "Example 9.12", "project": false, "ar": ["من المحاضرة: 150 = (13 − j14) I1 − (12 − j16) I2، و 0 = (27 + j16) I1 − (26 + j13) I2."], "code": "A = [13 - 14j, -(12 - 16j)\n     27 + 16j, -(26 + 13j)];\nI = A \\ [150; 0];\nIx = I(1) - I(2);\nfprintf('I1 = %g %+gj A, I2 = %g %+gj A, Ix = %g %+gj A\\n', real(I(1)), imag(I(1)), real(I(2)), imag(I(2)), real(Ix), imag(Ix))", "out": "I1 = -26 -52j A, I2 = -24 -58j A, Ix = -2 +6j A", "fig": null}, {"t": "The three voltages and the KVL check", "project": false, "ar": ["V1 = (1 + j2) I1، و V2 = (12 − j16) Ix، و V3 = (1 + j3) I2. ونتحقق −150 + V1 + V2 = 0."], "code": "V1 = (1 + 2j)*I(1); V2 = (12 - 16j)*Ix; V3 = (1 + 3j)*I(2);\nfprintf('V1 = %g%+gj, V2 = %g%+gj, V3 = %g%+gj V\\n', real(V1), imag(V1), real(V2), imag(V2), real(V3), imag(V3))", "out": "V1 = 78-104j, V2 = 72+104j, V3 = 150-130j V", "fig": null}, {"t": "Project idea: three unknowns with the constraint", "project": true, "ar": ["مشروع: نترك Ix مجهولًا ثالثًا ونضيف القيد Ix = I1 − I2 صفًا ثالثًا، بدل التعويض باليد."], "code": "M = [13 - 14j, -(12 - 16j), 0\n     -(12 - 16j), 13 - 13j,  39\n     1,           -1,       -1];\nx = M \\ [150; 0; 0];\nfprintf('I1 = %g%+gj, I2 = %g%+gj, Ix = %g%+gj\\n', real(x(1)), imag(x(1)), real(x(2)), imag(x(2)), real(x(3)), imag(x(3)))", "out": "I1 = -26-52j, I2 = -24-58j, Ix = -2+6j", "fig": null}]}